# =====================================================================
#  What this repo IS: the skill library — rules, contracts, templates.
#  What this repo is NOT: video footage, renders, or per-video work.
#
#  Rules are EXTENSION-based first and path-based second, deliberately.
#  A path rule only protects folders that exist today; an extension rule
#  protects you from the folder you create next year.
# =====================================================================

# ── Media, anywhere in the tree — the hard backstop ──────────────────
# No video, audio or project file reaches GitHub regardless of location.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aiff
*.flac
*.prproj      # Premiere
*.aep         # After Effects
*.drp         # DaVinci Resolve
*.fcpbundle   # Final Cut
*.psd
*.ai
*.r3d
*.braw

# Large images. Contact sheets are regenerable — the ffmpeg one-liner is
# in _meta/source-media.md. Delete these two lines if you'd rather
# version the visual evidence; they're ~9MB.
assets/frames/
*.tiff
*.exr

# ── Per-video work ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every video edit happens in _projects/<name>/. That is YOUR work, not
# shared library content, and its footage would dwarf the repo.
# `**` not `*` — `_projects/*` matches only direct children, so a scratch
# file one level deeper (e.g. _projects/my-edit/notes.txt) would leak through.
_projects/**

# EXCEPT the design documents and the build manifest. These are the
# highest-signal artifact the library produces: proof a rule works, the
# record of what was decided, and the feedback loop when a rule turns out
# wrong. Small markdown, worth versioning. Everything else in a project
# folder — footage, renders, scratch, caches — stays local.
!_projects/*/
!_projects/*/design/
!_projects/*/design/*.md
!_projects/*/BUILD.md
!_projects/*/README.md

# ── Style profiles ARE tracked ───────────────────────────────────────
# A profile is reusable library content, not per-video output. Not ignored.
# (_profiles/ intentionally absent from this file.)

# ── HyperFrames install — upstream, npx-based, re-scaffolds from SETUP.md ──
hyperframes/

# ── Junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
*.tar.gz
*.zip
.env
.env.*
